                "message": "✨ feat: add gh-pr-pdf, a repo's PRs as org files and a Typst PDF\n\nNew Stow package gh-pr-pdf: one script that wraps github-backup, writes\none org file per pull request (description, conversation, reviews, inline\nreview comments, commits linked to GitHub) plus all.org, and builds a\npaginated PDF with pandoc and Typst. Discussions are optional.\n\nAlso adds a row to stow-migration/packages.tsv so the package is in the\nper-machine list that migrate.sh derives. No CHANGELOG edit, per the\nnightly-tidy rule.\n\nNot run: typst compile, github-backup against a real repository, the\nDiscussions fetch. The org and Typst-source output was checked on made-up\nJSON. See gh-pr-pdf/README.org, section \"Not run\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi91AWH6eASFA8xAktp",
